  "repair": "A bounded whole-focused-editor read routes before Apple planning and model fallback. It discovers the current AXTextArea via real MCP, reads AXRole/AXValue for its helper-generation-bound ID, and verifies the same actual AX control, app, window, document identity, exact value and selection across awaits. Truncated, malformed, wrong, ambiguous or stale evidence cannot complete the task. A Stop before dispatch executes no MCP read.",
  "task": "Tell me the complete text of the open TextEdit document.",
  "implementationLimits": [
