    "Actual tests use a disposable real TextEdit process/document and the signed packaged helper. The passing diagnostic harness wraps the live host snapshot method only to retain field-level scope samples; it supplies no fixture answer or target to production logic.",
    "Normal managed helper installation and full HostSession/client/phone paths remain unqualified.",
    "The UI-unresponsiveness runtime warning remains in both final real-app bundles and the regression bundle. Its cause and heat/12 GB whole-app acceptance remain unresolved.",
